# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-EP3H1`.
#
# The production path: the real `orgasmic` binary against a real daemon, with
# the lifecycle write for TASK-CLEANUP answered 503 by a proxy in front of it.
# That is the shape of what was measured on 2026-07-29 — the close tx lands,
# the second request does not — and it is not reproducible below the CLI,
# because the tear is between two of the CLI's own requests.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-cli --test dispatch torn_dispatch_close_lifecycle_is_repaired_by_next_manager_command
